sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Temporary credentials still need item-level authorization
accDescr: Social sign-in supplies a token, Cognito issues scoped credentials, and DynamoDB evaluates the caller identity against the requested partition key.
participant M as Mobile app
participant I as Social identity provider
participant C as Cognito identity pool
participant D as DynamoDB authorization
M->>I: Sign in
I-->>M: Identity token
M->>C: Exchange token
C-->>M: Temporary role credentials
M->>D: GetItem for user U
D->>D: Allowed action and LeadingKeys matches identity?
alt Own user key
D-->>M: Preferences
else Another user key
D-->>M: Access denied
end
